/T (Learn4All is an inclusive learning progress and resource planner for school students in Classes 6 to 10. A student signs in, picks a lesson from the NCERT-linked course library, takes a short multiple-choice quiz and needs 70% to unlock the next lesson. Anything below the line lands in a personal revision list with a one-click retake. Every score feeds a dashboard, trend charts, achievements and a class leaderboard.)
/E (Learn4All is an inclusive learning progress and resource planner for school students in Classes 6 to 10. A student signs in, picks a lesson from the NCERT-linked course library, takes a short multiple-choice quiz and needs 70% to unlock the next lesson. Anything below the line lands in a personal revision list with a one-click retake. Every score feeds a dashboard, trend charts, achievements and a class leaderboard.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [15]
>>
