<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 108 0 R
/T (A teacher or school admin signs in to a separate workspace with a class overview heatmap, a marks updater, a monitoring list of students who need a check-in, and a notice board that can target everyone, one class or a single student. The whole application runs locally on plain Python with an SQLite database, so there is nothing to install beyond Python itself.)
/E (A teacher or school admin signs in to a separate workspace with a class overview heatmap, a marks updater, a monitoring list of students who need a check-in, and a notice board that can target everyone, one class or a single student. The whole application runs locally on plain Python with an SQLite database, so there is nothing to install beyond Python itself.)
